※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4421 LANG_ENUM_UNKNOWN_VALUE

※ A value of an enumeration is one of the names its definition lists, whether
※ it is written as a value or as the arm of a `match` that takes it.

enum Colour { red ; green }

let chosen: mut Colour = Colour.mauve

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    match chosen:
        red:
            return 1u6
        mauve:
            return 2u6
